<ContentPage
  pageKey="iut"
  title="The IUTs"
  heading="The University Institutes of Technology"
  description="The 115 IUTs of France: university education recognised by companies, varied training programmes, VAE and further studies abroad."
>
  <p class="lead">
    The University Institutes of Technology in France are spread throughout the country and number
    115, which ensures a strong anchoring in the local and regional economic environment. Meetings
    between IUT department directors ensure the national coherence of education.
  </p>
  <p>
    The IUT has a quality of university education recognised and acclaimed by companies for more
    than 40 years, thanks to the introduction of programmes adapted to professional reality and the
    creation of diplomas answering the emergence of new professions.
  </p>
  <p>
    Training covering most sectors (secondary and tertiary) and offering the collaboration of
    professionals makes the strength and success of IUTs, and actually allows students to find work
    in the 6 months following graduation.
  </p>
  <p>
    This diversification of diplomas and training leads to setting up different pedagogical modes,
    suitable for a larger number of students and professionals wishing to resume studies or do a
    validation of acquired experience (VAE).
  </p>
  <p>
    In addition, IUTs, in partnership with foreign universities, offer further studies abroad, as
    well as internships.
  </p>
